                  are synonyms, but a different word refers to a different context and intuition).
              %li
                %p
                  One sometimes write the above data as
                  = succeed "." do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mover
                            %mi A
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ¯
